SearchBarWidget({
  required TextEditingController controller,
  required ValueChanged<String> onChanged,
  VoidCallback? onClear,
  String hintText = 'Search transactions...',
})
```

## Navigation
- Home AppBar → search icon → push `/search`
- History AppBar → search icon → push `/search`
- Back button closes search and clears query

## Design Rules
- Background: #FFFFFF (light) / #000000 (dark)
- Search bar background: #F5F5F5 (light) / #1C1C1E (dark)
- Highlight matched text in results: bold black
- No colors — monochrome only
- Keyboard type: text, textInputAction: TextInputAction.search
